        You do not have the required permissions or user role to view this panel.
    </p>
    <div class="flex justify-center pt-4">
        <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold py-2.5 px-6 rounded-xl transition">
